The bus stops where there is no stop. The doors fold open on
wet grass. Rain, light and steady. At the foot of the step the
grass begins to climb, and it goes on climbing. It is a hill.
Up at the top, against a sky with a few stars in it, there is
a weather station: white slatted boxes on posts, a wind vane,
a low brick building with one lit window.

[narrator · region 9]
